#Протокол_WorkGraph_Recovery_Policy_Presets<[
Базис:
  Autonomous backlog execution needs explicit recovery semantics for failed worker output, repeated failure, missing dependency, verification failure and environment blockers.
  Recovery presets do not silently mutate canonical .bvc; they produce evidence-backed transition suggestions consumed by operator or a future apply-transition API.
Вектор:
  Presets: worker_failed_first, worker_failed_repeated, env_blocker, verification_failed, rate_limit_retry, no_claimable_task.
  worker_failed_first: first failure -> blocked or ready with retryAdvice; records worker-run evidence; distinguishes model_failure vs policy_denied.
  worker_failed_repeated: retryCount >= maxRetries -> blocked with escalation summary and human_review hint.
  env_blocker: missing Go, network, credentials -> blocked with env_blocker class; no automatic retry until evidence shows env fixed.
  verification_failed: task in verify with failed Tier A command -> ready with narrowed next_action or blocked if repeated.
  rate_limit_retry: schedule next tick with backoff metadata in audit; task stays claimed/ready per policy.
  Each preset maps to transition suggestion: ready | verify | blocked | escalate_human with required evidence line template.
Цель:
  WorkGraph OS continues without silent loops; operator can see why retry, block or escalation happened.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: workgraph-recovery-policy-presets
  work.source: design-recovery-policy-presets
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Preset_Matrix<[
Базис:
  Presets must be testable pure functions over worker output and retry context.
Вектор:
  classifyFailure(output, context) -> failureClass: model_failure | policy_denied | code_failure | env_blocker | no_task | succeeded.
  suggestRecovery(failureClass, { retryCount, maxRetries, taskStatus }) -> { preset, action, reason, retryAdvice }.
  Default maxRetries=2 for worker_failed before worker_failed_repeated escalation.
  action enum: retry_ready, stay_blocked, stay_verify, escalate_human, noop.
Цель:
  src/workGraphRecoveryPolicy.mjs implements the matrix; daemon tick and live-loop consume the same suggestions.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: workgraph-recovery-preset-matrix-v1
  protocol.id: workgraph-recovery-policy-presets
  trace.status: verified
]>
